    title: 'The Grammar of the Invisible City: Ibn Khaldun and the Philosophy of Asabiyyah',
    subject: 'Ibn Khaldun',
    subtitle: 'What if the rise and fall of civilisations is governed not by the will of God or the genius of leaders, but by an invisible social force that cities simultaneously require and destroy?',
